# resource-aware training run.
*.npz

# Module 16 (Local Inference) writes no files - it never stores images, results,
# or models - so it needs no ignore rules.

# Module 8 outputs (resource_training_history.json, per-run
# *_resource_statistics.json) are already covered by the blanket *.json rule
# above - no separate pattern needed.


